            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LovesCooking"
            },
            "reviewBody": "There was a huge discount on the zucchinis at my local grocery store and I was in the mood for something different and this recipe did not disappoint. These creme bars are definitely easy on the eyes with their smooth light green color and two layered presentation. The flavor is also spot on, especially tasty with some vanilla ice-cream to go with it. I think it tastes even better the next say after it rests in the fridge overnight.",
